@startuml deployment
title D33 · Despliegue validado: un host Docker Compose (CI / desarrollo)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #356D77
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F3F8FA
  BorderColor #286B75
}

node "Equipo cliente (navegador)" as WebHost {
  artifact "Surf Club web\n(server.mjs :4173,\nproxy /v1 mismo origen)" as Web
}
node "Equipo cliente (terminal)" as PyHost {
  artifact "compunube_client\n(Python 3.12)" as Py
}

node "Host Docker (Linux o Windows 10 + WSL2)" as Host {
  node "red Compose compunube" as Net {
    node "match-service-go" as Go {
      artifact "compunube-match-service:<rev>\n:8080 HTTP E45 + WS E43" as GoA
    }
    node "envoy" as Envoy {
      artifact "envoyproxy/envoy:v1.31.10\n:50051 gRPC, :9901 admin" as EnvoyA
    }
    node "player-profile-rust-1" as R1 {
      artifact "compunube-player-profile-service:<rev>\n:50051 gRPC, :9100 métricas" as R1A
    }
    node "player-profile-rust-2" as R2 {
      artifact "compunube-player-profile-service:<rev>\n:50051 gRPC, :9100 métricas" as R2A
    }
    node "postgres" as PG {
      database "postgres:17-alpine\n:5432, volumen postgres-data\nschemas match / player" as PGA
    }
    node "db-migrate (one-shot)" as Mig
    node "prometheus :9090 / grafana :3000\npostgres-exporter :9187" as Mon
  }
}

Web --> GoA : HTTP + WebSocket\n(GO_HTTP_PORT, host → :8080)
Py --> GoA : HTTP + WebSocket (Bearer)
GoA --> EnvoyA : gRPC envoy:50051
EnvoyA --> R1A : gRPC + health check
EnvoyA --> R2A : gRPC + health check
GoA --> PGA : SQL rol match_runtime
R1A --> PGA : SQL rol player_runtime
R2A --> PGA : SQL rol player_runtime
Mig --> PGA : migraciones y roles
Mon ..> GoA
Mon ..> R1A
Mon ..> R2A
Mon ..> EnvoyA
Mon ..> PGA

note bottom of Host
  Topología verificada en CI Integration: todos los servicios en un host.
  La distribución entre los equipos del laboratorio (D31) queda pendiente de A05;
  no se fijan IPs ni hostnames.
end note
@enduml
